<title>USA: Fed says 5-day fixed system RPs totaled $5.289 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed says 5-day fixed system RPs totaled $5.289 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve added a total of $5.289 billion via a five-day fixed system operation Wednesday, the New York Fed confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
